{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1790970000, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "A live install, driven in plain language (narration-paced)"}
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[1;36m== A live install, driven in plain language ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.3, "o", "Seven nodes, IBM Storage Scale 6.0.1.1, NFS + SMB + S3, fresh TechZone environment.\r\n"]
[0.6, "o", "Real calls and real results, via the scale-guinstall MCP server.\r\n"]
[24.8, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 1. Pre-flight check ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.1, "o", "\u001b[1;32mUser:\u001b[0m \"backend is up, check it\"\r\n"]
[25.15, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33m(read-only)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.2, "o", "\u001b[33m  ping()   check_operation()   spectrumscale_running()   probe_mmfs()\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.23, "o", "\u001b[33m  check_ansible()   check_locale()   probe_interfaces()\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.26, "o", "\u001b[33m  list_nodes(toolkit=/usr/lpp/mmfs/6.0.1.1/ansible-toolkit/spectrumscale)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.29, "o", "\u001b[33m  list_config(toolkit=/usr/lpp/mmfs/6.0.1.1/ansible-toolkit/spectrumscale)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.32, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.37, "o", "  backend ok; no operation running; no spectrumscale process\r\n"]
[25.4, "o", "  toolkit /usr/lpp/mmfs/6.0.1.1/ansible-toolkit/spectrumscale (6.0.1.1)\r\n"]
[25.43, "o", "  ansible-core 2.14.18 OK (< 2.24)   LC_ALL=C.UTF-8   installer eth0 10.249.129.31\r\n"]
[25.46, "o", "  no nodes, no cluster name, callhome Enabled (default), GPFS not installed yet\r\n"]
[46.8, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 2. Nodes and disks ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[47.1, "o", "\u001b[1;32mUser:\u001b[0m \"Can you reach all the nodes and do the storage servers have free disks?\"\r\n"]
[47.15, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33m(read-only)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[47.2, "o", "\u001b[33m  test_connection(node=\"scale-server1\")   test_connection(node=\"scale-proto1\")\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[47.23, "o", "\u001b[33m  list_devices(node=...) for server1/2, proto1/2, gui1, client1/2\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[47.26, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[47.31, "o", "  \u001b[31mtest_connection: SSH connection to scale-server1 failed (exit 255)   (proto1 the same)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[47.34, "o", "  list_devices, scale-server1 and scale-server2: vdd vde vdf, 100 GB each, unused\r\n"]
[47.37, "o", "  list_devices, proto1/2, gui1, client1/2: OS disk only\r\n"]
[47.4, "o", "\u001b[2;37m  (list_devices reached every node over SSH, so the agent moves on)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[76.8, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 3. The hosts file ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[77.1, "o", "\u001b[1;32mUser:\u001b[0m \"Here are the hosts.\"  [pastes /etc/hosts]  \"S3 is present\"\r\n"]
[77.15, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33m(none - the agent reads the paste)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[77.2, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[77.25, "o", "  CES pool: ces.scale.lab = 10.249.128.200 and 10.249.128.201, on eth1\r\n"]
[77.28, "o", "  proto1/proto2 eth1 leases are .21 and .10, so the pool addresses are separate\r\n"]
[77.31, "o", "  scale-win-client1 (Windows) is left out of the cluster\r\n"]
[102.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 4. Toolkit setup ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[102.3, "o", "\u001b[1;32mUser:\u001b[0m \"Set up the toolkit using the bastion as the installer node\"\r\n"]
[102.35, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mstart_setup(\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[102.4, "o", "\u001b[33m  dir=/usr/lpp/mmfs/6.0.1.1/ansible-toolkit, ip=10.249.129.31, dry_run=true)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[102.43, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[102.48, "o", "  [DRY RUN] Inputs validated; command not executed: ... setup -s 10.249.129.31\r\n"]
[102.51, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mstart_setup(..., dry_run=false)   then check_operation()\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[102.56, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[102.61, "o", "  Port 10080 will be used for package distribution.\r\n"]
[102.64, "o", "  SUCCESS\r\n"]
[116.4, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 5. Seven nodes ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[116.7, "o", "\u001b[1;32mUser:\u001b[0m \"Add the seven nodes: server1 and 2 as NSD/quorum/manager, gui1 as quorum/admin/GUI,\r\n"]
[116.75, "o", "      proto1 and 2 as protocol/manager, the two clients plain\"\r\n"]
[116.8, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mstart_node_config(dry_run=true, then false)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[116.85, "o", "\u001b[33m  scale-server1 / scale-server2 : nsd, quorum, manager\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[116.88, "o", "\u001b[33m  scale-gui1                    : gui, quorum, admin\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[116.91, "o", "\u001b[33m  scale-proto1 / scale-proto2   : protocol, manager\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[116.94, "o", "\u001b[33m  scale-client1 / scale-client2 : (no roles)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[116.97, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[117.02, "o", "  dry run: node delete + node add -n -q -m / -g -q -a / -p -m / (none), per node\r\n"]
[117.05, "o", "  \u001b[31mlive: [FATAL] Node ... does not exist  (the delete, expected)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[117.08, "o", "        [WARN] mis-ordered line in /etc/hosts  (harmless)   Configuration updated, x7\r\n"]
[117.11, "o", "  check_operation: success; list shows all 7 nodes\r\n"]
[142.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 6. Storage ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[142.3, "o", "\u001b[1;32mUser:\u001b[0m \"add the storage for the NSDs\"\r\n"]
[142.35, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mstart_nsd_add(dry_run=true, then false)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[142.4, "o", "\u001b[33m  /dev/vdd -> cesSharedRoot   /dev/vde, /dev/vdf -> fs1\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[142.43, "o", "\u001b[33m  scale-server1 failure group 1, scale-server2 failure group 2, dataAndMetadata\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[142.46, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[142.51, "o", "  nsd add -p scale-server1 -u dataAndMetadata -fg 1 -fs cesSharedRoot /dev/vdd  (x6)\r\n"]
[142.54, "o", "  The installer will create the new file system cesSharedRoot / fs1 if it does not exist.\r\n"]
[142.57, "o", "  list_nsds:  nsd1 cesSharedRoot FG1 vdd s1 | nsd2 cesSharedRoot FG2 vdd s2\r\n"]
[142.6, "o", "              nsd3 fs1 FG1 vde s1 | nsd4 fs1 FG2 vde s2 | nsd5/nsd6 fs1 vdf s1/s2\r\n"]
[164.4, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 7. Cluster settings, and two real mistakes ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[164.7, "o", "\u001b[1;32mUser:\u001b[0m \"keep going through the runbook. rpcbind and eth ips are good to use\"\r\n"]
[164.75, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mstart_cluster_config_apply(callhome=false, perfmon=true,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[164.8, "o", "\u001b[33m  gpfs_flags=[-p gpfsProtocolDefaults, -e 60000-61000], perfmon_node=\"scale-gui1\")\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[164.83, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[164.88, "o", "  \u001b[31mconfig gpfs -p: the user defined profile 'gpfsProtocolDefaults' does not exist\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[164.91, "o", "  \u001b[31mconfig perfmon: [ FATAL ] Unrecognized arguments: '-N', 'scale-gui1'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[164.94, "o", "  applied anyway: port range 60000-61000, callhome disabled\r\n"]
[164.97, "o", "\u001b[2;37m  (the toolkit had already chosen gpfsprotocoldefaults itself; -N is not in 6.0.1.1)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[165.02, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mstart_cluster_config_apply(callhome=false, perfmon=true)   # no profile, no node\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[165.07, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[165.12, "o", "  Callhome is already Disabled.   Setting perfmon to on.\r\n"]
[165.15, "o", "  file audit logging and grafana bridge disabled in the definition.   SUCCESS\r\n"]
[194.4, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 8. Protocols from the web UI ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[194.7, "o", "\u001b[2;37m(same request, continuing: the Apply Protocols panel in the Scale-GUInstall page)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[194.75, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mPOST /api/stream/protocols/config\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[194.8, "o", "\u001b[33m  {filesystem: cesSharedRoot, mountpoint: /ibm/cesSharedRoot, interface: eth1,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[194.83, "o", "\u001b[33m   export_ip_pool: 10.249.128.200,10.249.128.201, dry_run: false}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[194.86, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[194.91, "o", "  Setting export_ip_pool / filesystem / mountpoint / interface\r\n"]
[194.94, "o", "  [OK] Protocol configuration set.\r\n"]
[194.97, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mPOST /api/stream/protocols/enable   {protocols: [nfs, smb, s3], dry_run: false}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[195.02, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[195.07, "o", "  Enabling NFS, SMB, S3 on all protocol nodes\r\n"]
[195.1, "o", "  [OK] Enabled: nfs, smb, s3.   (list_nodes: S3, SMB, NFS Enabled; pool .200/.201)\r\n"]
[215.6, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 9. Precheck and install ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[215.9, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mstart_phase(phase=\"precheck-install\")\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[215.95, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[216.0, "o", "  WARN: NSDs have one server each (local VM disks).   Pre-check successful for install.\r\n"]
[216.03, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mstart_phase(phase=\"install\")   # 19:34Z, then check_operation() as it runs\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[216.08, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[216.13, "o", "  check_operation: 100,733 characters, saved to a file by the harness\r\n"]
[216.16, "o", "  $ grep -E 'FATAL|failed=[1-9]|PLAY RECAP' <saved log>   -> no failures\r\n"]
[216.19, "o", "  spectrumscale_running() -> processes: []   (the cheap \"is it done\" probe)\r\n"]
[216.22, "o", "  Installation successful. 7 GPFS nodes active in cluster scale-gui1-qvtqsu3k.\r\n"]
[216.25, "o", "  Completed in 26 minutes 18 seconds.\r\n"]
[239.2, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 10. Postcheck and deploy precheck ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[239.5, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mstart_phase(phase=\"postcheck-install\")\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[239.55, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[239.6, "o", "  GPFS ACTIVE  NSDs ACTIVE  Performance Monitoring ACTIVE  GUI ACTIVE\r\n"]
[239.63, "o", "  All services running\r\n"]
[239.66, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mstart_phase(phase=\"precheck-deploy\")\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[239.71, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[239.76, "o", "  protocol precheck OK   S3 precheck OK   SMB precheck OK   NFS precheck OK\r\n"]
[239.79, "o", "  Pre-check successful for deploy.   (3m52s; the log only advances between tasks)\r\n"]
[256.4, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 11. Deploy ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[256.7, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mstart_phase(phase=\"deploy\")   # 20:11Z\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[256.75, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[256.8, "o", "  ASYNC FAILED on scale-server1: jid=...   (a status line; the task still shows changed)\r\n"]
[256.83, "o", "  PLAY RECAP: failed=0 unreachable=0 on all seven nodes\r\n"]
[256.86, "o", "  File systems have been created successfully\r\n"]
[256.89, "o", "  Filesystem ACTIVE  CES ACTIVE  S3 ACTIVE  SMB ACTIVE  NFS ACTIVE  Perfmon ACTIVE  GUI ACTIVE\r\n"]
[256.92, "o", "  Successfully installed and configured protocols. 2 protocol nodes were enabled.\r\n"]
[256.95, "o", "  It took 17 minutes 31 seconds.\r\n"]
[280.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 12. Final postcheck ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[280.3, "o", "\u001b[1;33mClaude calls:\u001b[0m \u001b[33mstart_phase(phase=\"postcheck-deploy\")\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[280.35, "o", "\u001b[1;37mResult:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[280.4, "o", "  Filesystem ACTIVE   Cluster Export Services ACTIVE   S3 ACTIVE   SMB ACTIVE   NFS ACTIVE\r\n"]
[280.43, "o", "  Performance Monitoring ACTIVE   GUI ACTIVE   SUCCESS   All services running\r\n"]
[287.2, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== Closing ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[287.5, "o", "A full install, one web page, and a handful of plain sentences from the operator.\r\n"]
[287.8, "o", "The agent picked the tools and caught its own two mistakes from the toolkit's errors.\r\n"]
[305.2, "o", ""]
